ityInstance`. Tests drive abilities that way.","originalFile":"# Key decisions log\n\n- **E1**: TODO said to fire `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` only in `cast_spell`. Also\n  fired it in `cast_spell_free` — casting without paying mana is still casting\n  (rule 601.2), and sos_226/sos_257 triggers must see free casts (e.g. spells\n  cast off sos_1/sos_120). Copies made via `copy_spell` still never fire it.\n- **sos_1**: `AttacksTriggeredEvent` existed (FDN cards register on it) but the\n  engine never fired it; added the fire in `declare_attackers_step` after all\n  attackers are declared (rule 508.4). Additive; no existing test registers\n  attack triggers through combat, so no behavior change elsewhere.\n- **sos_1**: \"If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead\"\n  — `move_to_zone` only consulted replacements for battlefield exits. Added a\n  `SpellToGraveyardReplacementEvent` (subclass of MoveToGraveyard…) passed by\n  `_resolve_spell` for instants/sorceries, and extended `move_to_zone` to\n  consult replacements for stack exits too. Replacement is one-shot, keyed on\n  the specific spell object. Limitation: a counterspell that bins the card\n  directly (fdn_48-style `_counter_spell`) bypasses move_to_zone and isn't\n  intercepted.\n- **sos_1**: per TODO, when exactly one legal graveyard target exists the\n  trigger auto-selects it (no prompt); the \"may\" decline is only offered via\n  `choose_card` returning None when there are 2+ candidates.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":19,"oldLines":3,"newStart":19,"newLines":19,"lines":[" - **sos_1**: per TODO, when exactly one legal graveyard target exists the","   trigger auto-selects it (no prompt); the \"may\" decline is only offered via","   `choose_card` returning None when there are 2+ candidates.","+- **sos_257**: restricted mana is a per-type count inside `ManaPool`","+  (`add_restricted` + optional `spell=` param on `can_pay`/`pay`, threaded","+  through `cast_spell`). Only one restriction kind exists","+  (instant/sorcery-only) — deliberate single-card limitation. Restricted mana","+  is treated as spent first when eligible.","+- **sos_257**: animation mutates the card in place and updates","+  `_original_card_types` so `EffectManager.apply_all` resets don't undo it","+  (the effect has no duration). The pump is a normal Layer-7c until-EOT","+  continuous effect; `apply_all` is invoked after adding so it is immediately","+  observable. Animated land is not summoning sick (per plan note). If the","+  animated land left and re-entered the battlefield it would stay a creature —","+  accepted edge, not reachable in these tests.","+- **Ability activation in tests**: the engine has no index-addressed","+  `ActivateAbility` helper; the real activation path is","+  `engine.abilities.activate_ability` over `get_*_abilities()[index]` wrapped","+  in `ActivatedAbilityInstance`. Tests drive abilities that way."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
