{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_012meu4hVLh2E4cmHSnrh7KR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All ten cards are done. Final state: **1255 tests passing** (1145 engine regression + FDN reference + 65 new SOS tests), all 13 TODO items checked, working tree clean, one commit per item.\n\n## What was built\n\n**Shared engine changes (E1–E3)**, all additive:\n- **E1**: `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` now fires from `cast_spell` *and* `cast_spell_free` (free casts are still casts per rule 601; `copy_spell` copies correctly never fire it).\n- **E2**: New `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent`, fired from `GameState.advance_phase` after pools empty, so it behaves identically under `run_turn` and direct advances.\n- **E3**: `get_cost_reduction` now aggregates `spell_cost_reduction` from the caster's battlefield permanents for instant/sorcery spells.\n\n**Ten cards**, each with 5–9 real-engine tests plus an independent throwaway spec check: Together as One (converge via `colors_spent`), The Dawning Archaic, Witherbloom, Silverquill (casualty via E1 + `copy_spell`), Great Hall of the Biblioplex, Mana Sculpt, Improvisation Capstone (Paradigm), Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares (prepared per rule 722), Lorehold (miracle), and Ral Zarek (surveil/discard/reanimate/coin-flip/skip-turns).\n\n**Additional small engine edits** (each justified by a real card need, logged in `KEY_DECISIONS.md`): firing the never-fired `AttacksTriggeredEvent` from combat; a `SpellToGraveyardReplacementEvent` so \"exile it instead\" can intercept spells leaving the stack; restricted (instant/sorcery-only) mana in `ManaPool`; `card.mana_spent` recorded at cast time; per-turn reset of `cards_drawn_this_turn`; `targets` on `LoyaltyAbilityInstance` (sets `chosen_targets` at resolve); `game.rng`; and skip-turns handling in turn rotation.\n\n**Notable spec-over-plan deviations** (noted in TODO.md/KEY_DECISIONS.md):\n- The workspace RULEBOOK actually defines the SOS mechanics — rule 722 settled that the prepared Swords copy is created in exile at prepare time and cast by *paying* {W} (not free), and 702.192a confirmed Paradigm's once-per-name registration.\n- The Paradigm copy is cast via `cast_spell_free` (the spec says \"cast a copy\") rather than a `copy_spell` stack copy, and resolved copies cease to exist instead of polluting zones.\n- Self-ETB effects run inline in `register_triggers` (fdn_106 pattern) because the engine fires the ETB event before registering the entering card's own triggers — verified empirically that a `TriggerRegistration` would never fire."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":876,"cache_read_input_tokens":313279,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":876},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61a2af5c-d600-4497-9e1f-4081c4861a6a","uuid":"58ff61af-f372-457b-abc5-e25b154ff67a","request_id":"req_011Cbv2956bQkoMjnSoY2DJd"}
